OL,3,W"###"###"###T//,.-,.,,.-.-,.,/,-./,-,./
OL,4,C'Nobody knew Isla was dying, now she   
OL,5,Cmight change that for others'          
OL,6,GThe parents of a teenage girl who died 
OL,7,Gfrom breast cancer say she would be    
OL,8,Gproud her name is being used in a      
OL,9,Gscheme which might save the lives of   
OL,10,Gother young people.                    
OL,12,FIsla Sneddon, from Airdrie in North    
OL,13,FLanarkshire, died in March 2025 at     
OL,14,Fjust 17 years old.                     
OL,16,FHer parents say doctors dismissed her  
OL,17,Fsymptoms as anxiety or hormone changes 
OL,18,Fbecause of her age, meaning her cancer 
OL,19,Fwent undetected until it was too late. 
OL,22,                                   G1/4 
