OL,4,CCare home predator sexually assaulted  
OL,5,Cmy mum despite warnings                
OL,6,GA man has told BBC News how his        
OL,7,Gelderly mother, who was suffering from 
OL,8,Gdementia, was sexually assaulted by a  
OL,9,Gfellow resident in a care home in      
OL,10,GInverclyde.                            
OL,12,FThe man - who we are calling John to   
OL,13,Fprotect his mother's identity - said   
OL,14,Fthe "horrific" sex attack took place   
OL,15,Fdespite concerns previously being      
OL,16,Fraised by staff about the behaviour of 
OL,17,Fthe attacker.                          
OL,22,                                   G2/4 
