OL,3,W"###"###"###T//,.-,.,,.-.-,.,/,-./,-,./
OL,4,CBarlinnie prison has had 'significant' 
OL,5,Cissues with water supply for six years 
OL,6,GScotland's biggest prison has had      
OL,7,G"significant" issues with its water    
OL,8,Gsupply for at least six years, it has  
OL,9,Gbeen revealed.                         
OL,11,FMore than five million litres of water 
OL,12,Fwere lost during an incident last      
OL,13,Fmonth at HMP Barlinnie in Glasgow      
OL,14,Fwhich left some prisoners without      
OL,15,Frunning water in their cells, the      
OL,16,FScottish Prison Service (SPS) said.    
OL,22,                                   G3/4 
OL,23,D]CNews IndexG102CFlashG150CRegionalG160
