OL,3,W"###"###"###T//,.-,.,,.-.-,.,/,-./,-,./
OL,4,CGeorge Square reopens after #20m       
OL,5,Crevamp - but council issues chewing    
OL,6,Cgum warning                            
OL,7,GGlasgow's George Square has reopened   
OL,8,Gafter a delayed #20m revamp - but the  
OL,9,Gcity council has already had to issue  
OL,10,Ga warning about chewing gum being spat 
OL,11,Gout there.                             
OL,13,FThe city landmark closed at the start  
OL,14,Fof 2025 for work to begin, only for    
OL,15,Fthe project to be delayed several      
OL,16,Ftimes.                                 
OL,18,FIt has now reopened in full for the    
OL,19,Fcity's Christmas celebrations to take  
OL,20,Fplace.                                 
OL,22,                                   G4/4 
